# Reviewed 2026-11-19: removed 2 obsolete/parked service domains and tightened 3 suffix entries to exact hosts.
# Original: GlobalAI_Merged_Sukka_DOMAIN-SET.list
# UPDATED: 2026-11-19 - curated Sukka AI additions
# Sukka source: https://ruleset.skk.moe/List/non_ip/ai.conf (source updated 2026-11-15)
# Sukka rules are licensed AGPL-3.0: https://github.com/SukkaW/Surge
# Entries newly approved from Sukka: 13; exact-to-suffix upgrades: 3
# Ambiguous/general endpoints are excluded from default and may appear in optional file.
# Surge DOMAIN-SET format
# Leading dot = DOMAIN-SUFFIX; no leading dot = exact DOMAIN
# Use DOMAIN-SET,filename,AI in [Rule]
# GlobalAI CLEAN / conservative cross-provider AI policy
# Purpose: Surge AI routing, NOT ad blocking, NOT MITM.
# Original source inspected: https://magicrule.pages.dev/data/_shared/artifacts/GlobalAI_rules_7591fffa97b1e679.list
# Conservative manual curation; some domain entries may be supplements.
# Policy is configured on the DOMAIN-SET line in [Rule].
# No IP/ASN, DOMAIN-KEYWORD, PROCESS-NAME or URL-REGEX.

